t 10\\cdot 9\\cdot {x}^{2}+⋯+{x}^{10} \\\\  & =1+10x+45{x}^{2}+⋯+{x}^{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for small $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n{(1+x)}^{10}≈1+10x+45{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $x=-0.001$ into the above approximation of $(1+x)^{10}:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(0.999)^{10} & =(1+(-0.001))^{10} \\\\  & ≈1+10(-0.001)+45(-0.001)^{2} \\\\  & =1-10(0.001)+45(0.000\\,001) \\\\  & =1-0.01+0.000\\,045 \\\\  & =0.990\\,045,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nto six decimal places." 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361546 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361547 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361548 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361549 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361550 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1041 "selection" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1104 #edb/ref 17592186361549 13194139535690 true] [17592186361545 1110 #uuid "84b4fcd5-82ef-55b9-a533-781c5113666d" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361546 1034 "0.009\\,955" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535690 true] [17592186361546 1111 #uuid "c87fa59e-ff39-5893-9f73-36a746d12b91" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361547 1034 "0.999\\,950" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535690 true] [17592186361547 1111 #uuid "b42493b9-8cc8-527b-852c-dbb0b4ca01b2" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361548 1034 "0.990\\,043" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361548 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535690 true] [17592186361548 1111 #uuid "30eae97d-bc28-50db-b152-8e61d6d26260" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361549 1034 "0.990\\,045" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361549 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535690 true] [17592186361549 1111 #uuid "cff75207-ac40-5eb5-aae7-73974a57dcfa" 13194139535690 true] [17592186361550 1034 "1.010\\,045" 13194139535690 true] [175921863